WEBVTT

00:13:29.346 --> 00:13:31.702
kendu edo eraman.

00:13:31.702 --> 00:13:35.800
Argia ez da inoiz itzaltzen.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:37.910
Mediku zoragarri batek behin esan zidan bezala,

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:41.161
"Ez esan niri besteek zuri buruz esan dizutena.

00:13:41.161 --> 00:13:44.212
Kontatu edozer zuri buruz."

00:13:44.212 --> 00:13:46.018
Eskerrik asko.

00:13:46.018 --> 00:13:51.542
(Txaloak)